{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43186","headline":"险竿行 · 柳曾","name":"险竿行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山险惊摧輈，水险能覆舟。\n奈何平地不肯立，走上百尺高竿头。\n我不知尔是人耶复猱耶？\n使我爲尔长叹嗟。\n我闻孝子不许国，忠臣不爱家。\n尔今轻命重黄金，忠孝两亏徒尔夸。\n始以险技悦君目，终以贪心媚君禄。\n百尺高竿百度缘，一足参差一家哭。\n险竿儿，听我语，更有险徒险於汝。\n重於权者失君恩，落向天涯海边去。\n险竿儿，尔须知，险途欲往尔可思。\n上得不下下不得，我谓此辈险於险竿儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43186.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43186","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}